#. あっ、苗木！！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ah, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. …無事だったん？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#. お主も、モノクマに話を聞いて、
#. ここにやって来たんだな？
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Did Monokuma talk to you, too?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クン、朝日奈さん、大神さん…
#. それに…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro, Hina, Sakura, and..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 十神クン…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya..."
msgstr ""

#. この４人だけ…？　他のみんなは？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're the only ones here? Where's everyone else?"
msgstr ""

#. すでにモノクマの言葉を確かめに行っているか、
#. あるいは…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Either they're already off trying to verify what\n"
"Monokuma said..."
msgstr ""

#. ヤツの言う<CLT 3>“何か”<CLT>に巻き込まれているか…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...or they've fallen victim to the \"<CLT 3>something<CLT>\" that\n"
"Monokuma mentioned ."
msgstr ""

#. な、何かって…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The...something?"
msgstr ""

#. もしや…また起きたのではあるまいな…
msgctxt "0011 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "It can't be... Has it happened again?"
msgstr ""

#. 殺人が……
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Murder...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは、モノクマの言葉を聞いて、
#. 真っ先に頭に浮かんだ最悪の可能性…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After hearing what Monokuma had to say, the worst\n"
"possibility forced its way into my mind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最悪ゆえに…
#. 真っ先に追い払われた可能性…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It took everything I had to drive that thought away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だとしたら、昨日のあれのせいって事か？
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"S-So if something really did happen... Does that mean\n"
"someone did it cuz of what happened yesterday?"
msgstr ""

#. ありえないよ！　たかが<CLT 3>“思い出”<CLT>だよ！？
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It can't be! That stuff was just a bunch of <CLT 3>old\n"
"memories<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. たかが…？　それはどうかな…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "\"Just\" old memories? Don't be so sure about that."
msgstr ""

#. そう思えない人間だって、
#. いたはずだぞ…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Clearly someone felt it was more important than that."
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分を基準にして価値判断を行う…
#. それが、どれほど危険な行為か気付かないのか？
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To judge someone else's values based on your own\n"
"outlook... Do you realize how dangerous that is?"
msgstr ""

#. だったら…なんで昨日そう言わなかったのよ…！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh—? Why didn't you say something yesterday!?"
msgstr ""

#. もう忘れたのか？　これは協力し合うゲームじゃない。
#. 蹴落とし合うゲームなんだ。
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Did you already forget? This isn't a co-op game. It's\n"
"every man for himself."
msgstr ""

#. わざわざ助け船を出して、
#. 俺になんの得がある…！
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What good does it do me to go out of my way to help\n"
"you?"
msgstr ""

#. まだ…そんな事言ってんの…？
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Stop saying that already!"
msgstr ""

#. どうかしてんべ。
#. リアルな話、洗脳でもされてんじゃねーか？
msgctxt "0025 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"There's something wrong with him, for serious. Did he\n"
"get brainwashed or something?"
msgstr ""

#. 待て、それよりも今は
#. 何があったのかを突き止めるのが先だ…
msgctxt "0026 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's not important. What matters right now is that\n"
"we find out what happened..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだな…
#. では、手分けして探すとしようか。
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "She's right. Let's all split up and begin looking."
msgstr ""

#. フフ…行くぞ…
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmhm... The game is afoot."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今はこんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"can't think about this right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、何かあったなら…
#. このカメラでそれも見てたはずだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If something did happen...one of these cameras must\n"
"have caught it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計があって時間はわかるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a clock telling me what time it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は時間なんか気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...but I can't worry about time right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
